  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Typical ZOLLER – everything from a single source </h2>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER always takes one step further when developing new products, creating solutions for the future. We’ve been following this principle for decades—and not just with our measuring machines. Equip yourself for tomorrow’s digital requirements and prepare for the smart factory of the future—with our ZOLLER Tooling Solutions.</p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [
    {
     "kind": "iframe",
     "src": "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/OKLwuZLfF2s?autohide=1&controls=1&enablejsapi=1&origin=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.zoller.info",
     "title": "ZOLLER Tooling Solutions – Werkzeughelden"
    }
   ],
   "pos": "right",
