  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> ZOLLER Solutions for Efficient Manufacturing </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Take advantage of our ZOLLER Tooling Solutions to make your manufacturing process effective. We offer a complete program of high-performance, high-precision toolholding systems for your machining tasks. ZOLLER Tooling Solutions also serve as the perfect interface for your digital manufacturing.</p>",
